# Coverage output. `cargo llvm-cov` writes its report into the crate directory,
# and a plain `RUSTFLAGS="-Cinstrument-coverage"` run drops `default_<hash>_<pid>`
# profiles into whichever directory invoked cargo — easy to land in the repo root
# by accident, where they are large binary files.
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info

